final heuristicOverhead = await probeHeuristicOverhead();
// #2416 merge: the slim manifest shrank the seam overhead the
// 1.12× multiplier was sized against — at the merged ~2.7k seam the
// old window left the calibrated resume estimate within a whisker
// of the trigger and the post-run hand-over gate fired a SECOND
// model call (contexts.single threw). Sizing the window ABOVE the
// unanchored overhead plus a full forWindow reserve keeps the
// regime OFF (trigger > overhead: no soft-window warning) while
// the calibrated estimate stays well under the trigger (one
// request, no relief, no trim).
final window = heuristicOverhead + 1300;

